  "description": "All Jung Hyun-Do wanted was a steady job, but he faced constant rejection. Determined to toughen up, he goes to Gwidu Mountain to improve his stamina, only to wind up hopelessly lost. In the midst of Hyun-Do's despair, a shaggy-haired man suddenly emerges from the shadows and whisks him away! The wild man introduces himself as Woo Jae-Chang, and a wary Hyun-Do knows this might be his only chance to escape. Will Hyun-Do and Jae-Chang make it off the mountain, or will it be their final resting place?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
